# macOS / archive junk
.DS_Store
._*
**/._*

# Experiment provenance is intentionally tracked.
!progress/
!progress/**
# Keep provenance records, but not macOS AppleDouble sidecars copied with them.
progress/._*

# Compact mirrors of run summaries are tracked under reports/.
!reports/
!reports/**
